      "name": "ms-about-about",
      "settings": {
        "background_color": "{{ settings.color_palette.background }}",
        "content_main_title": "Background and Development",
        "content_title": "From Account Manger to Developer",
        "content_text": "<p>After 6 years in sales, marketing, and account management, I discovered that the problem-solving, attention to detail, and client-focused mindset that shaped my career in the BPO industry translate naturally into front-end and Shopify development.</p><p>Today, I bring that same approach to building and customizing Shopify stores—combining technical skills with a strong understanding of client needs, business goals, and user experience.</p><p>I believe great websites are more than just good-looking designs. They should be reliable, purposeful, easy to use, and built to help a business grow. My goal is to turn your ideas into a Shopify experience you can confidently share with your customers.</p>",
        "image_content": "shopify://shop_images/my_profile.jpg",
        "margin_top": 80,
        "margin_bottom": 80
      }
