      "name": "ms tools",
      "settings": {
        "tools_title": "My Inventory",
        "text_tools_title": "TECHNICAL EXPERTISE",
        "text_tools_description": "<p>My toolkit includes <strong>React, TypeScript, and Next.js</strong> for building scalable applications, along with <strong>Tailwind CSS</strong> for pixel-perfect designs. I'm passionate about web performance, accessibility, and creating intuitive user experiences that work flawlessly across all devices.</p><p>In my transition to development, I've built and deployed multiple production applications, and completed <strong>Meta's Frontend Developer Certification</strong>—proving that career pivots at any stage can lead to expertise.</p><p>My mechanical background taught me that documentation prevents disasters—a practice that now results in <strong>clean, maintainable, and reusable code</strong> with comprehensive comments and clear commit messages that other developers love working with.</p>",
        "margin_top": 80,
        "margin_bottom": 80
